                  "guidance": false,
                  "description": "Apply a \"success\" badge to every healthy/active/normal item. If all rows show green \"Active\" badges, none stand out; the badge adds noise, not information. Show only the states that need user attention (errors, warnings, pending actions)."
                },
                {
                  "guidance": false,
                  "description": "Use badges for metadata. Durations (\"6h window\"), counts (\"12 trigger types\"), dates, and descriptions are not statuses or categories; use description text (Text with type=\"supporting\") instead."
